MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 105840137}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1194c0fad10c974d8394a09968b93a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f27ec067994d1094080621d92882d2c6, type: 3}
      line: WOW! Solid ground! I recognize that stuff.. And I'm guessing I'm miles
        away from where I actually have to be, right?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9eba19ed8a86a3845b658e178cf0f9fb, type: 3}
      line: Frankly, you could do with the exercise, Pac-Man. You're starting to
        look even more spherical than usual!
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7da4890dcb8ad1f4387497a1be395d39, type: 3}
      line: Hey! Ms. Pac-Man like me cuddly, okay? So what's with the big tower?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4212d572240fe1147a48eba06f0dff5a, type: 3}
      line: The first Spectral Syphon is somewhere within that structure; find it
        and shut it down.
