        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a776f91f1f0e584b9f3a3ca7c5c6da9, type: 3}
      line: You weren't brought up here, Pac-Man! Now, get after those ghosts!
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4462f5b1c8efd314a8f6c74c8cd43ba7, type: 3}
      line: I hear you, buddy! Any idea where I should be heading?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c8be093761b30f34697eef70f3f27a1d, type: 3}
      line: Well, my last received contact from Pinky came from right at the top
        of this realm, so head there.
