--- !u!114 &494693629
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 494693627}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1194c0fad10c974d8394a09968b93a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 253bd13b0c0b5bc4296fa045cc6b5f84, type: 3}
      line: Uh-ohhh.... I'm detecting a rise in energy in your sector, Pac-Man!
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 022ff30834f6a24458fabfba078ead9f, type: 3}
      line: Details of my sector's energy should be between me and Ms. Pac, thank
        you very much.
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be32075e3345b37469dc53d4a072481d, type: 3}
      line: Please, Pac-Man! Do you see a... swirly thing?
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b270f51f793ff4347a07b9d5a88e4907, type: 3}
      line: Yeah, yeah. Mr. No-Fun, swirly thing - check. Spewing ghosts - check.
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3355e4fcefbf6b240a8d2de8d5c76d5f, type: 3}
      line: "NOT ghosts - Spectral Monsters! Tougher than ghosts! You'll need a power-pellet!\t\t"
