--- !u!114 &705481189
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 705481187}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1194c0fad10c974d8394a09968b93a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8ea15502257036a45ae8fdd0eadec6d3, type: 3}
      line: Woah! Of all the ghostly things I ever ate, those are the least pleasant.
        I need a mint.
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fce7af6e1639f27479410277e4b9c8c6, type: 3}
      line: The Spectral Monsters come from the Spectral Realm, which is being syphoned
        by Erwin, which is why they're in a SERIOUSLY bad MOOD!
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 66698828dce491341ab07d416fc6be5a, type: 3}
      line: The "Spectral Realm"? Don't you ghosts have something to do with that?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ed003951bd17a74083748fdad85ca0a, type: 3}
      line: "It's OUR home, TOO! Now can you see why I need your help? I don't know
        exactly what Erwin's up to, but it involves my home, which is why I'm in
        a seriously bad mood! \t"
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8dc6f26294847aa4da2ee2b4a09f8b50, type: 3}
      line: Come and find me at the outpost. It's just a little bit further.
