--- !u!114 &826815522
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 826815519}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1194c0fad10c974d8394a09968b93a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 77592a6ef85314a49a6402dd97bd2834, type: 3}
      line: Pac-Man, can you hear me? Outpost callin' Yellow Fella! Repeat... can
        you hear me?
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 440973398819a9b4fbad69038bdb2d11, type: 3}
      line: My Pac-trometer! Who's there?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f293a63ab58440b4a9898ac5964a5de5, type: 3}
      line: Pac-Man!!
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6234307c9c6e590469bc1c7349a014d8, type: 3}
      line: The signal's bad here. Some idiot teleported me into a pit.
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f06866010262c4240bbee3e3da56f80f, type: 3}
      line: Is that clearer? You shouldn't rush to judgements, Pac-Man! Teleportation
        is not so easy!
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b4f74f88841c6974285d6da1df2bbb93, type: 3}
      line: Orson?! Is that you?! Are you, by any chance, the idiot of whom we speak?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: af2eff3f1eeb6b645a5667681650fc00, type: 3}
      line: I had pinpont control of the 'porter until you squirmed. I WOULD port
        you again, but I can't lock on! Where are you?
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2be0dee02c75e4e428064191e371e522, type: 3}
      line: I'm in some sort of... land-fill pit. There's... green goo, some trashed
        looking junk and... it smells really bad in here. REALLY!
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aa6d5b2cc8de2244187fda59ff6c6b4d, type: 3}
      line: Oooh, you're down theeere! Ewwwwww! Rather you than me... Make your way
        upwards. I'll... try to think of some way to help.
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5f2b4ee6ea3834949b634627a598d749, type: 3}
      line: What about the monsters? There's usually monsters at times like this...
