  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 81a6a6900306d6c4a87d27359e505c57, type: 3}
      line: What's with the Spectrals?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc5ae4d4c38ab324598122ae6f92f3d2, type: 3}
      line: Unhappy souls. They usually hide in the darkness of the caverns beneath
        the Spectral Realm. Erwin's syphoning seems to have stirred them up, though!
