--- !u!114 &1349021990
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1349021988}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1194c0fad10c974d8394a09968b93a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 38a371e8af545624caddc878de4be715, type: 3}
      line: Orson, I'd claim to be pleased to see you, but you messed up my party
        and threw me into a trash pit where lots of things with big, pointy teeth
        tried to turn me into lunch!
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 292416a9652e27548bd763d351379900, type: 3}
      line: This is serious, Pac-Man! Erwin is so hungry for power that he's syphoning
        energy from the Spectral Realm.
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 171caa952c22adf4c852c15a5b655e46, type: 3}
      line: So what can I do?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 22db6c724506d544da96a4a2184ee92a, type: 3}
      line: For starters, Inky, Blinky, Pinky, and Clyde have disappeared... I fear
        the worst. I want you to go to the Spectral Realm and check things out.
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b38cd594b95fd274d97e34d433ec4fe6, type: 3}
      line: A trip to a doomed place that's full of ghosts and Spectral Monsters...
        Hey, count me in!
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49015ef073224eb4a9bbbee99804eed7, type: 3}
      line: Good! But before that, I want you to help me calibrate Toc-Man!
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3aad1daaed5419a4ea7c8841a82359cd, type: 3}
      line: Toc-Man? You have a new Toc-Man? A new, big, giant robot Toc-Man?!!
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6e6e78c1c49c63e44bbbe0a4291792e8, type: 3}
      line: More than a normal giant robot, Pac-Man! Fifteen tons of the most start-of-the-art
        bad-guy smushing technology ever balanced on legs!
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae4cf19fb215b1e4e91d42f2c616e186, type: 3}
      line: COOOOL!!!
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e9a668d3ec9915048a688ffd9b242265, type: 3}
      line: Just try NOT to break this one, huh?
