  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1194c0fad10c974d8394a09968b93a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46d7ee75c8564164f8282834619fded7, type: 3}
      line: There's weird techno-stuff here, Ors. Yours?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a675e9d3296f394184160dfea8e7293, type: 3}
      line: Heavens, no! Shoddy craftsmanship like that... It all belongs to Erwin.
        He's building Spectral Syphons all over the place - keeps stockpiling raw
        materials.
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dfc356e007269de408a04c28e44529a8, type: 3}
      line: I'd like you to disrupt, distress, and otherwise blow up anything of
        his you see. Please.
