--- !u!114 &1945499838
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1945499836}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b1194c0fad10c974d8394a09968b93a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae830644e4c2e0742acfa951128898c2, type: 3}
      line: Hmmm... This looks arcane. Erwin's work, Orson?
    - character:
        name: Orson
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 978dbdacd167b58428f04e7d4b43707a, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e02703ec62ce0c04fb272100810fa711, type: 3}
      line: 'Indeed not. This has been here for... well, my instruments suggest...
        a very long time! The ancients didn''t want just anyone wandering around
        here, I guess. '
    - character:
        name: Pac-Man
        icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f5f83a1bf2a68345af8549e35da621f, type: 3}
        clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b65df577f8c050f47b4fbbbe2dc40b49, type: 3}
      line: So, a millenia-old puzzle, huh?... My speciality!
